#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tuning-preparing.rst:92
#: 95f93444a06943208a14a4c560a497ea
msgid ""
"UAV helicopters, as opposed to sport helicopters, will usually be running "
"low headspeed and higher disc loading. With a mechanically driven tail this "
"also means lower than normal tail speed and reduced tail authority. If your "
"helicopter meets this description, it is recommended to set "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_YAW_FF<ATC_RAT_YAW_FF__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` to 0.05 "
"before the first test hover."
msgstr ""
"与运动型直升机不同，无人机直升机通常以较低的旋翼转速和较高的桨盘负载运行。对于机械驱动的尾桨，这也意味着尾桨速度低于正常水平，尾桨权限降低。如果您的直升机符合此描述，建议在首次试飞悬停前将"
" :ref:`ATC_RAT_YAW_FF<ATC_RAT_YAW_FF__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` 设置为 0.05。"

